CB007219_AA26_Verify_succ_CA_setup_with_altnative_bands_when_the_PCell_is_configured_with_small_dedicated_BWP-at_equal_aggregated_channel_bandwidth
    [Documentation]
    ...    1. This user scenario describes the successful setup of CA when some of the aggregated cells are configured with alternative bands and
    ...    the PCell is configured with a dedicated small BWP. successful CA setup with ative bands when the PCell is configured with small
    ...    dedicated BWP aggregated channel bandwidth,gNB-CU selects the band combination that is provided first in the U-NR-Capability,
    ...    with its associated (first/one) FSEI, small scell IDs will be filtered out first.
    ...    2. Configuration
    ...    CB008541:actEnhMultipleDedicatedBWPs =true, actMultipleDedicatedBWPs=true
    ...    CB007219:NRBTS/actMfbiNrCaSupportFr1 is set to "true"
    ...    5GC001416:NRBTS/actMultiFrequencyBandIndicatorNRSupport=true
    ...    Cell configuration:
    ...                      Cell_11    Cell_12    Cell_13    Cell_14    Cell_15    Cell_16    Cell_1    Cell_2
    ...    Technology type    FDD    FDD    FDD    FDD    FDD    FDD    TDD    TDD
    ...    Frequency    F0    F1    F2    F3    F4    F5    F6    F7
    ...    Common channel bandwidth    15    20    20    20    20    15    100    100
    ...    Small BWP    NA     NA    NA    NA    15    NA    NA    NA
    ...    DL MIMO Layers    4L    4L    4L    4L    4L    4L    4L    4L
    ...    Native band    N26    N2    N2    N2    N7    N7    N78    N78
    ...    Alternative band    N5    N25    N25    NA    NA    NA    N77    N77
    ...    UE1 capability: CA relation: cell15+cell16+cell11, A1 scell addition
    ...    BC#1: n7B                n7    n7
    ...    FSEI#1:DL MIMO layers    4L    4L
    ...            DL ChBw (MHz)    15    15
    ...    BC#2: n7(2A)             n7    n7
    ...    FSEI#1:DL MIMO layers    4L    4L
    ...            DL ChBw (MHz)    15    15
    ...    BC#3:n7A-n26A            n7    n26
    ...    FSEI#1:DL MIMO layers    4L    4L
    ...            DL ChBw (MHz)    15    20/15
    ...    A1 for scell addition is configured in PCell and A2 for scell is configured in SCells.
    ...    3. Test Case Steps:
    ...    a. attach UE1 to cell15, and trigger A1 for scell addition. Start DL/UL traffic.
    ...    expected cell11 is added as scells successfully. 5G-UE serving cells and respective measurement objects are configured at
    ...    5G-UE to operate as follows: Cell15 in band n7, Cell11 in band n26. BC#3FSEI#1(bandCombinationIndex is 6) is
    ...    selected. cell15 is configured with small BWP.
    ...    b. release UE and check counters.
